<title>SPAIN: Mapfre to buy rest of Euroamerica Seguros.</title>
<headline>Mapfre to buy rest of Euroamerica Seguros.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish insurance group Corporacion Mapfre said on Monday its Mapfre Internacional unit is to buy a further 55 percent of Chile's Euroamerica Seguros Generales S.A., bringing its total stake to 100 percent.</p>
<p>It also plans to increase capital in the firm by around $5-$6 million &quot;in order to incrase equity and support future development,&quot; Mapfre said in a statement.</p>
</text>
